OL,3,AMore than 700,000 without power after
OL,4,AHurricane Isaias makes landfall in
OL,5,AFlorida
OL,6,
OL,7,FHurricane Isaias leaves hundreds of
OL,8,Fthousands of people without power in
OL,9,FAlabama, Georgia and Florida, with all
OL,10,Fthree states declaring emergencies
OL,12,FFlooding is a continuing risk, Florida
OL,13,FGovernor Ron DeSantis says as he warns
OL,14,Fof a "very hazardous situation"
OL,16,FWinds peaked at 120mph (193km/h) before
OL,17,FIsaias made landfall in Florida late on
OL,18,FFriday - images show houses battered by
OL,19,Fwinds and felled trees
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
