OL,3,AMore than 700,000 without power after
OL,4,AHurricane Isaias makes landfall in
OL,5,AFlorida
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo people are dead in Alabama,
OL,8,Faccording to the governor, while one
OL,9,Fperson was killed after a tree fell on
OL,10,Fhouse in Florida, officials say
OL,12,FIsaias peaked as a category three
OL,13,Fhurricane, bringing heavy rain and
OL,14,Fpowerful wind, but has since been
OL,15,Fdowngraded
OL,17,FIn addition to Isaias, Tropical Storm
OL,18,FRachel is expected to hit southern
OL,19,FCalifornia later on Saturday, and
OL,20,FHurricane Simon will hit the Pacific
OL,21,Fcoast of Mexico on Sunday
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
